 "description": "\n <p><strong>Description:</strong></p>\n <p>1. 360° Free Rotating Foraging Design</p>\n <p>This pet feeder toy supports clockwise &amp; counterclockwise full rotation. Pets need to push and spin the transparent roller to roll out snacks, extending feeding time to slow down fast eaters, effectively preventing indigestion, bloating and choking risks.</p>\n <p>2. Safe Sturdy Plastic Material, Easy to Clean</p>\n <p>Made of food-grade thickened plastic, wear-resistant, bite-resistant and non-toxic. Smooth surface without sharp edges, fully detachable structure, you can rinse it directly with water after use, no food residue hidden inside.</p>\n <p>3. Interactive Mental Stimulation Toy, Relieve Pet Boredom</p>\n <p>Combines feeding and puzzle training. It encourages pets to use their sense of smell and brain to hunt for food, consumes extra energy, reduces destructive behaviors like scratching furniture, barking or anxiety when staying alone.</p>\n <p>4. 3 Fresh Color Options for Matching Home Decor</p>\n <p>Comes in 3 lovely solid colors: bright yellow, fresh green and soft pink. Cute triangular base shape fits all home styles, small footprint won’t take up much space on floor, living room or pet corner.</p>\n <p>5. Anti-Slip Raised Base, Stable During Play</p>\n <p>The bottom is equipped with thick raised anti-slip bumps, which greatly increase friction with wooden floors, tiles and carpets. The feeder won’t slide or tip over no matter how pets push and spin it during play.</p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\n <p>Color: Green/Yellow/Pink</p>\n <p>Material: Plastic</p>\n <p>Size: 21*18*13cm</p>\n <p>Suitable: For cat/dog</p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\n <p>1*pet feeder</p>\n",
